# ============================================================================================
# ops/crontab.manifest -- the desk's scheduler, as source (gap #58)
#
# *** RECONSTRUCTED FROM IN-REPO EVIDENCE 2026-07-29 -- NOT yet verified against the live box.
# *** The operator OWES a `crontab -l` paste + `systemctl list-timers` (register row #58,
# *** deadline 2026-08-05). Until that verification lands, this manifest is the DR FLOOR,
# *** not ground truth: restore-from-GitHub + deploy/reconstitute_cron.sh yields a desk that
# *** RUNS AGAIN, not necessarily a byte-identical twin of the VPS.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS (docs/GAP_REGISTER.md:272, row 58): 5 systemd timers were committed but
# the recorder, spot recorder, executor respawn, run_alerts, shadows, the */5 divergence
# sampler and the pgrep self-heals all ran from an UNCOMMITTED VPS crontab -- 119/162 scripts
# had no in-repo scheduler reference, so live and dead were indistinguishable from source and
# a GitHub restore ran NOTHING. This file is the missing half of the desk's genome.
#
# FORMAT (parsed by scripts/check_scheduler_manifest.py; installed by
# deploy/reconstitute_cron.sh):
#   - real 5-field crontab lines for cron-owned jobs ($QUANT_ROOT is set by the installer;
#     on the live VPS it is /home/quant/quant-platform);
#   - `SYSTEMD unit="..." on="..." exec="..."` lines for systemd-owned units (the installer
#     enables committed ones when systemctl exists; exec paths are repo-relative);
#   - every entry carries its EVIDENCE (file:line) and a CONFIDENCE tag:
#       committed-unit      the unit file is in this repo -- schedule is exact
#       documented-cadence  cadence read from dated in-repo observation of the live box
#       inferred            cadence or slot chosen here; only existence/frequency is evidenced
#   - where only the CADENCE is documented, the command SHAPE (log path, flock lock name,
#     exact minute) is reconstructed in the house pattern and is honestly `inferred` detail.
#
# KNOWN GAP, stated loudly: the live box shows ~20-22 active cron lines with flock guards
# (docs/research/deep_sweep/20260729_infrastructure.md:44-45, .../20260729_data-intelligence.md:222-223)
# and 21 quant-* systemd units (docs/research/deep_sweep/20260729_infrastructure.md:171); this
# reconstruction names 17 cron lines and 13 units. The remainder is exactly what the operator
# paste closes -- e.g. the unknown 00:02 writer of deribit_surface/crypto_regime
# (docs/research/deep_sweep/20260729_data-intelligence.md:93-97) is NOT reconstructable from
# the repo and is deliberately absent rather than invented.
# ============================================================================================

QUANT_ROOT=/home/quant/quant-platform

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MONEY-PATH SUPERVISION -- cron plane
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# watchdog: 3-min self-heal tick. Each tick also runs run_alerts.py (the pager),
# run_leverage_opt.py, run_live_combined.py and data_health.py, and heartbeat-gates respawn of
# executor / deadman / liquidations / dashboard / tunnel -- deferring to systemd when a unit
# owns the process (scripts/watchdog.py:57-100; the 2026-07-26 dual-supervision orphan is why).
# The executor's 10-min reconciler is INSIDE the executor process (--interval 600,
# scripts/watchdog.py:187-188; docs/institutional_knowledge.md:328), not a separate cron line.
# EVIDENCE: docs/research/deep_sweep/20260729_infrastructure.md:55-56 ("cron (3-min) ->
#   scripts/watchdog.py"); docs/institutional_knowledge.md:490 ("watchdog.py (cron, every 3min)")
# CONFIDENCE: documented-cadence
*/3 * * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/watchdog.py >> data/watchdog.log 2>&1

# venue-truth divergence sampler: every 5 min, read-only (calibrates the gap-#19 breaker band).
# EVIDENCE: docs/GAP_REGISTER.md:272 ("the */5 divergence sampler");
#   docs/research/deep_sweep/20260729_data-intelligence.md:77 ("venue_divergence every 5m")
# CONFIDENCE: documented-cadence
*/5 * * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/run_venue_divergence_shadow.py >> data/cro_ai_logs/venue_divergence_cron.log 2>&1

# RATCHET FENCE (constitution L1.0/L2.0): every measurable property of the desk reported as
# value (floor, distance-to-100%), failing on any regression / unmeasured / unfloored metric.
# --ratchet records improvements only; it can never lower a floor. The 55% -> 90% test-strength
# move of 2026-07-29 is the tempo this fence exists to make permanent and self-initiated.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/check_ratchets.py (built 2026-07-29); docs/CONSTITUTION.md L1.0
# CONFIDENCE: committed-script (new this cycle)
7 7 * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/check_ratchets.py --ratchet --json >> data/cro_ai_logs/ratchets.log 2>&1

# KIMI HUNTER (Deep Forest Protocol, waves 1->2->3 enforced in code). BUILT and automated on the
# box per commit a9a4dcd ("cron at 06:00 UTC + full-chain mock proves funding is the only
# remaining variable") but ABSENT FROM THIS MANIFEST until 2026-07-30 -- i.e. live-only
# scheduling, invisible from source, the exact class gap #58 exists to catch. Blocked on
# OpenRouter credit (402); the harness no-ops cleanly without it and fires the moment credit lands.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/kimi_hunter.py:3 ("cannot RUN until OpenRouter is funded"); commit a9a4dcd
# CONFIDENCE: documented-cadence (06:00 UTC from the commit message)
# CADENCE RAISED to maximum sustainable 2026-07-30 (principal: "as frequently as possible for
# maximum exhaustive ROI, optimal and deep"). SIX runs/day at 4-hourly spacing + a WEEKLY DEEP
# sweep. Frequency is deliberately bounded by SPEND, not by a hand-picked number: the monthly
# envelope guard in run_external_panel/panel_budget ($100-150/mo HARD, page-and-abort, never a
# silent quality cut) is what caps real usage, so the cron can be aggressive without risking the
# 2026-07-24 incident class ($21.48 in one day from unbounded resend). Each run executes the full
# wave 1->2->3 protocol; duplicate finds are suppressed by the graveyard + novelty gate, so extra
# frequency cannot manufacture duplicate work.
5 */4 * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/kimi_hunter.py >> data/cro_ai_logs/kimi_hunter.log 2>&1
# WEEKLY DEEP: longer budget, targets previously unexplored languages/regions/eras per L1.11a.
35 5 * * 0 cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/kimi_hunter.py --deep >> data/cro_ai_logs/kimi_hunter_deep.log 2>&1

# INTELLIGENCE CYCLE: activates the dormant intelligence-compounding layer. MEASURED 2026-07-30:
# meta_learning, research_priority, capital_reallocator, health_monitor, marketplace,
# weight_optimizer, lifecycle_actions, moat_audit and revalidate_clocks all existed with ZERO
# CALLERS -- the principal's "highest-ROI missing subsystems" were built and never executed. One
# organ runs them all and writes web/intelligence_cycle.json; NO-INPUT is reported as a DATA/ALPHA
# gap, never a silent skip.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/run_intelligence_cycle.py (built 2026-07-30); docs/CONSTITUTION.md L2.9
# CONFIDENCE: committed-script (new this cycle)
50 */6 * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/run_intelligence_cycle.py >> data/cro_ai_logs/intelligence_cycle.log 2>&1

# ENFORCEMENT MATRIX: maps all 43 constitutional principles to the 71 mechanical fences, in BOTH
# directions, and FAILS on any of three defects: an unenforced principle, a mapping to a missing
# artifact, or a fence claimed by no law. Every defect found 2026-07-30 was an unenforced-principle
# defect (capacity parity written in L1.18 while a $100k floor ran in the gauntlet; L2.9
# activate-the-unused written while 171 capabilities sat dormant). The reverse direction was closed
# 2026-07-30 (39 unclaimed fences -> 0) and RATCHETED: a new fence must name the law it serves.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/build_enforcement_matrix.py (built 2026-07-30); docs/CONSTITUTION.md L2.0/L2.2
# CONFIDENCE: committed-script (new this cycle)
13 7 * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/build_enforcement_matrix.py >> data/cro_ai_logs/enforcement_matrix.log 2>&1

# IMMUTABLE CONSTITUTIONAL CORE (L2.8a): the organism may amend its own constitution, so five
# clauses are SHA-256 sealed against it -- L1.1 (the objective function), L1.2 (the hierarchy),
# L1.6 (never-loosen validation + the two-stage law), L1.23 (survival rails, Tier-3), and L2.8a
# itself. THE FAILURE THIS EXISTS FOR: a self-improving optimiser permitted to rewrite its own
# limits will eventually find that the cheapest way to raise a measured return is to lower the rail
# constraining it. Runs BEFORE the matrix so a tampered core is the first thing the day reports.
# Drift FAILS LOUD and is never auto-reverted -- --reseal is a principal action only.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/check_constitution_core.py + data/constitution_core.lock (sealed 2026-07-30);
#           tests/governance/test_constitution_core.py proves the seal discriminates
# CONFIDENCE: committed-script (new this cycle)
7 7 * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/check_constitution_core.py >> data/cro_ai_logs/constitution_core.log 2>&1

# PROMOTION QUEUE (L1.18a, principal concern 2026-07-30: the shadow->live process must not be so
# slow that "by the time they reach live the capital is already outgrown its capacity").
# capacity_race answered that question since 07-30 and EVERY CALLER WAS A TEST passing a hardcoded
# validation_days=90 -- both un-run and run against an assumption. This is its production caller,
# and it feeds the race a MEASURED latency (clock + queue-wait + decision lag, each with its
# provenance). Forward slots are then ordered by EXPIRY, SHORTEST RUNWAY FIRST: a long-runway edge
# loses nothing by waiting, a short-runway one loses everything, so arrival order systematically
# sacrifices exactly the edges that cannot afford to wait. SUB-VIABLE and OUTGROWN candidates are
# excluded rather than back-sorted. A DOA edge is NEVER rescued by a shorter clock or a lower bar.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/run_promotion_queue.py + libs/research/promotion_latency.py;
#           tests/research/test_promotion_queue.py (13 tests incl. the accelerant refusals)
# CONFIDENCE: committed-script (new this cycle)
53 7 * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/run_promotion_queue.py >> data/cro_ai_logs/promotion_queue.log 2>&1

# MAX PUSH (L1.0, principal order 2026-07-30: "every aspect should always aim and hunt to maximise
# itself 100% every single day, believing it never is"). The law already said the gap to 100% IS
# the work queue; what did not exist was the queue. Five separate "what is left" artifacts
# (ratchets, utilisation, enforcement matrix, wiring, gap register) were each true and none
# comparable, so the desk worked whichever one it happened to open. This merges them into ONE
# ranked queue by declared leverage, refreshing its producers first so it ranks today's numbers.
# THE ANTI-COMPLACENCY PROPERTY: it never reports "done". All-green escalates to
# MEASUREMENT-SET-TOO-SMALL, because a system that reaches 100% on everything it measures is
# measuring too little -- and UNMEASURED aspects outrank partially-complete ones, since every
# expensive defect this desk has found lived in something that carried no number.
# Runs LAST in the 06:xx-07:xx governance block so it reads that morning's fresh artifacts.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/run_max_push.py -> data/max_push_queue.json; docs/CONSTITUTION.md L1.0
# CONFIDENCE: committed-script (new this cycle)
41 7 * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/run_max_push.py >> data/cro_ai_logs/max_push.log 2>&1

# UTILISATION (L1.28a, principal order 2026-07-30: "idleness is also timid -- never leave any
# ceiling or capital idle"). Unused headroom is not safety, it is an unbooked loss. A wrong trade
# costs a bounded amount and announces itself; idle capacity costs its ENTIRE forward output
# stream and announces nothing -- an unfilled forward slot is evidence never accrued, an unread
# dataset a hypothesis never tested, a dormant module engineering already paid for returning zero.
# Enumerates every declared ceiling, measures it, and FAILS on idle headroom with no named binding
# constraint. UNMEASURED counts as ZERO: a ceiling nobody measures is idle by default.
# FIRST RUN found a real defect -- deployed capital reading 13,155/4,500 (over-limit), because
# equity had TWO sources of truth; every capacity band is a ratio to that number.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/check_utilisation.py -> data/utilisation.json; docs/CONSTITUTION.md L1.28a
# CONFIDENCE: committed-script (new this cycle)
27 6 * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/check_utilisation.py >> data/cro_ai_logs/utilisation.log 2>&1

# TIMIDITY FENCE (L1.28): about two thirds of the constitution's principles contain restraint
# language, every one of which a language model can degrade into a general licence to do less.
# The misreading is systematic, silent, and looks like good judgement. This requires every
# scope restraint to state its non-timid reading (or be declared EVIDENCE/RISK restraint, which
# stays strict), and it also scans the injected doctrine for timid ORDERS -- a phrase like
# "propose rather than build" there is a direct instruction to every organ to do less.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/check_timidity_language.py + tests/governance/test_timidity_fence.py
# CONFIDENCE: committed-script (new this cycle)
19 6 * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/check_timidity_language.py >> data/cro_ai_logs/timidity.log 2>&1

# MODEL AUTO-UPGRADE (principal order 2026-07-30: "auto-upgrade to newer flagship models, no human
# needed"). Model capability is the one input the desk cannot improve by its own work -- it
# improves when the vendor ships. Until today that improvement reached this desk only when a human
# noticed and hand-edited three files; every cycle in between ran on strictly worse reasoning than
# was available, with no error message. This discovers newer flagships, PING-VERIFIES that they
# actually answer for this account (listing is not entitlement), and PREPENDS the winner above the
# current head, which is RETAINED as the fallback -- so a promoted model that throttles degrades
# to exactly what ran yesterday with nobody awake. An undeclared model FAMILY is paged, never
# adopted. Daily at 04:11 UTC: before the 05:xx organs, after the overnight cycle.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/run_model_upgrade.py + libs/ops/model_chain.py + ops/model_chain.env (single
#           source, extracted from 3 hardcoded copies 2026-07-30); tests/ops/test_model_chain.py
# CONFIDENCE: committed-script (new this cycle)
11 4 * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/run_model_upgrade.py --apply >> data/cro_ai_logs/model_upgrade.log 2>&1

# WIRING AGENT: built things get WIRED automatically (principal order 2026-07-30). Detection
# alone reproduced the original failure one level up -- a dormancy report nobody actions is itself
# a dormant capability. This ACTS: auto-wires only what it can PROVE is inert-by-construction
# (runnable main(), no money-path import, no spend capability, no writes outside data/+web/), and
# PROPOSES everything else with the reason it was withheld. Tier-3 and the executor are NEVER
# touched, not even proposed. Idempotent: rewrites its own fenced block, never hand-written lines.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/run_wiring_agent.py (built 2026-07-30); docs/CONSTITUTION.md L2.9
# CONFIDENCE: committed-script (new this cycle)
44 9 * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/run_wiring_agent.py --apply >> data/cro_ai_logs/wiring_agent.log 2>&1

# MINER RUNWAY DOCTOR: daily. Distinguishes never-ran / creds-missing / not-scheduled / stale
